msgid ""
"Each standalone switch port reaches the firmware as its own VLAN node on the "
"GMAC above. A bridge has one node that all its switch ports share, and a "
"VLAN-aware bridge has one for each of its VLANs."
msgstr "每个独立交换机端口都会作为 GMAC 上的独立 VLAN 节点接入固件。普通网桥由所有交换机端口共享一个节点；支持 VLAN 的网桥则为每个 VLAN 分配一个节点。"

msgid "Fast lane"
msgstr "快速通道"

msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

msgid ""
"Firmware armed but heartbeat silent — check the system log; a reboot returns "
"to the host stack"
msgstr "固件已启动但心跳无响应——请检查系统日志；重启后将恢复由主机网络协议栈处理"

msgid "Firmware-attached ports"
msgstr "已接入固件的端口"

msgid "Grant access to the NSS offload status page"
msgstr "允许访问 NSS 卸载状态页面"

msgid "Heartbeat"
msgstr "心跳"

msgid "Host stack (NSS plane not armed)"
msgstr "主机协议栈（NSS 数据平面尚未启动）"

msgid "Link"
msgstr "链路"

msgid "NSS Offload"
msgstr "NSS 硬件卸载"

msgid "NSS core %s load"
msgstr "NSS 核心 %s 负载"

msgid "NSS core load"
msgstr "NSS 核心负载"

msgid "NSS offload active (wifili)"
msgstr "NSS 卸载已启用（WIFILI）"

msgid "NSS offload active (wifili, 802.11s mesh offloaded)"
msgstr "NSS 卸载已启用（WIFILI，802.11s Mesh 也已卸载）"

msgid "NSS offload active (wifili; 802.11s mesh configured, not offloaded)"
msgstr "NSS 卸载已启用（WIFILI；已配置 802.11s Mesh，但 Mesh 未卸载）"

msgid "NSS temperature"
msgstr "NSS 温度"

msgid "No ports attached — host stack"
msgstr "没有端口接入——由主机协议栈处理"

msgid "Node"
msgstr "节点"

msgid "Offload active"
msgstr "卸载已启用"

msgid ""
"Offloaded packets are forwarded by the firmware and never reach the host. "
"\"via host\" / \"to host\" is the host↔firmware exception path — what was "
"not offloaded — so low numbers there mean offload is working. Broadcast and "
"multicast discovery, connection setup, short-lived flows and traffic "
"addressed to the router itself always take that path: a flow is only "
"offloaded once it is established, so a quiet port that carries little else "
"shows a low offloaded share. Port totals are on Status → Overview."
msgstr "已卸载的数据包由固件直接转发，不会到达主机。“经主机”/“发往主机”表示主机与固件之间的例外路径，即未被卸载的流量，因此这些数值较低通常意味着卸载正在正常工作。广播和组播发现、连接建立、短连接，以及发往路由器自身的流量始终走这条路径：连接建立后才会进行流量卸载，因此业务量较少的端口可能显示较低的卸载占比。端口总计数据可在“状态 → 概览”中查看。"

msgid "Other SoC temperature"
msgstr "其他 SoC 温度"

msgid "PPPoE manager"
msgstr "PPPoE 管理器"

msgid ""
"Packets through the firmware's Wi-Fi data path since boot, per radio. \"RX "
"(REO)\" is every frame the radio received; \"RX delivered\" counts only "
"frames for an AP or STA interface, so frames of an offloaded 802.11s mesh "
"link show up in the first column only."
msgstr "自启动以来每个无线电通过固件 Wi-Fi 数据路径处理的数据包数量。“RX (REO)”表示无线电接收的所有帧；“RX delivered”仅统计交付给 AP 或 STA 接口的帧，因此已卸载的 802.11s Mesh 链路帧只会计入第一列。"

msgid "Port"
msgstr "端口"

msgid "RX (REO)"
msgstr "接收（REO）"

