msgid ""
"The offloaded share is part of the GMAC's figures above; the totals here are "
"each port's own switch counters, all its VLANs together."
msgstr "已卸载流量占比已包含在上方 GMAC 的统计数据中；此处的总计来自各端口自身的交换机计数器，并合并统计该端口的所有 VLAN。"

